Reading the Bus Pirate . . .
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE { 0xD6 0x28 { 0xD7 r:6 }// read the imu 
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READ: BUS_PIRATE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE WASTE RS_MSB RS_LSB
SET: RESULT = [%RS_MSB%]
//SET: RESULT = [%RS_LSB%]
